    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.sphigx.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.sphigx.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:sphigx"><head>ΣΦΙΓΞ</head>
          <pb n="606" facs="urn:hathi:iau.31858007086675:scan:614"/>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="219" xml:id="frag_c546d063d3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:sphigx" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.sphigx.nauck1889-grc1:235">
            <note type="source">Athenæus XV. p. 674 d. post verba supra fragm. 190. apposita ita pergit, καίτοι ἐν τῇ ἐπιγραφομένῃ Σφιγγὶ εἰπὼν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_c546d063d3-l1" xml:lang="grc">Τῷ δὲ ξένῳ γε στέφανος, ἀρχαῖον στέφος,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:id="frag_c546d063d3-l2" xml:lang="grc">δεσμῶν ἄριστος, ἐκ Προμηθέως λόγου.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">Libri στέφανον. Correxit Grotius.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="220" xml:id="frag_341948b9ca" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:sphigx" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.sphigx.nauck1889-grc1:236">
            <note type="source">Aristophanes Ranar. v. 1319.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_341948b9ca-l1" xml:lang="grc">Σφίγγα δυσαμεριᾶν πρύτανιν κύνα πέμπει.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">ubi scholiasta, ταῦτα δὲ ἐκ Σφιγγὸς Αἰσχύλου.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="221" xml:id="frag_db4d991a3e" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:sphigx" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.sphigx.nauck1889-grc1:237">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Κνοῦς: ὁ ἐκ τοῦ ἄξονος ἦχος. λέγεται δὲ καὶ κνόη. καὶ ὁ τῶν ποδῶν ψόφος, ὡς Α. Σ. Fabula fuit satyrica: v. supra p. 14.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text>
